ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids has come in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years for November to December, the most of any pair since 1951. In 2026 so far, the middle ran 8% of normal for February to March and 10% for March to April. Grid 20522 shows a preliminary estimate of 50.1 for July to August 2026. Grid 20820 had its driest year in 1956 at 42% of normal.</p>"}
